{"id": "62971", "title": "极品丫环", "author": "于小晨", "category": "其他类型", "count": 9, "available": 9, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/62/62971.htm", "intro": "上辈子过得太命苦的小芙，\r\n\r\n难得有机会再活一次，她决定放纵自已怠惰成性！\r\n\r\n但那该死的沙猪王爷，似乎就是看不惯，\r\n\r\n老是阻碍她过米虫的好日子！\r\n\r\n好呀！那就来尬尬看！\r\n\r\n21世纪来的丫环VS冷酷王爷，\r\n\r\n看谁比较利害…\r\n\r\n\r\n属性分类：穿越／其他／一般言情／轻松\r\n关键字：赵琰 　小芙 　唐玉萦", "base": "files/article/html/62/62971", "chapters": [{"title": "1-3", "file": "9335251.html", "available": true}, {"title": "4-6", "file": "9335252.html", "available": true}, {"title": "7-10", "file": "9335253.html", "available": true}, {"title": "11-14", "file": "9335255.html", "available": true}, {"title": "15-18", "file": "9335257.html", "available": true}, {"title": "19-21", "file": "9335258.html", "available": true}, {"title": "22-25", "file": "9335261.html", "available": true}, {"title": "26-28", "file": "9335262.html", "available": true}, {"title": "29-30完结", "file": "9335263.html", "available": true}]}